  "citation": "Molognoni, Daniele; Bosch-Jimenez, Pau; Rodríguez-Alegre, Rubén; Marí-Espinosa, Adrián; Licon, Edxon; Gallego, Julia; et al. (2020). Table_1_How Operational Parameters Affect Electromethanogenesis in a Bioelectrochemical Power-to-Gas Prototype.DOCX. Frontiers. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.3389/fenrg.2020.00174.s004",
